```mermaid
---
title: View elements
---
erDiagram
    TitleView {
        String title
        Image icon
        Style style
    }
```
```mermaid
erDiagram
    ControlItem {
        Image icon
        String title
        View accessoryView
        Function action
    }
```
```mermaid
erDiagram
    ControlItemSwitch {
        Bool state
    }
```
```mermaid
erDiagram
    NavigationItem {
        Image backIcon
        Image forwardIcon
        NavigationController navigation
    }
```
```mermaid
erDiagram
    TabBarItem {
        TitleView title
        Function close
    }
```


```mermaid
---
title: List view
---
erDiagram
    OutlineView ||--|{ FileItem : files
    OutlineView
    FileItem {
        String name
        Image icon
        Bool isFolder
    }
```
Composite view
```mermaid
graph TD;
    Controls-->TitleView & ControlItem & ControlItemSwitch;
```

```mermaid
graph TD;
    Tabbar-->TabBarItem & Button;
```

